WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:13.620
It’s project time! Build a catching game: things fall as clones from random places, the player moves smoothly, catching scores points, and the game ends after a time limit or when lives run out.

2
00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:24.230
Build a catching game: things fall as clones, the player moves smoothly, catching scores points, and the game ends after a time limit or when lives run out.

3
00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:28.740
Make some clones good (stars) and some bad (bombs).

4
00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:34.120
Use pick random to choose each clone’s costume, and a different rule for each.

5
00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:37.390
Add a timer or lives.

6
00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:41.940
When time is up or lives reach 0, say the score and stop all.

7
00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:49.530
Playtest and tune the numbers: fall speed, how often clones appear, and the player’s speed.

8
00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.080
Fun games are hard but fair.

9
00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.300
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:58.650
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
